SUMMARY:HXD Week: Tour of IAH Terminal B
DTSTAMP:20260807T044508Z
DTSTART:20260806T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come experience the Terminal B Transformation at IAH\, a landma
	rk project that is setting a new standard for air travel. Discover how Uni
	ted Airlines and the Houston Airport System are creating an innovative\, s
	ustainable terminal that celebrates the spirit of Houston while delivering
	 a seamless and elevated passenger experience. The project encompasses one
	 million square feet and features a new terminal lobby\, expanded concours
	es with 22 gates\, and the largest airline lounge in North America\, which
	 will serve United Airlines. \nFirms:\nGrimshaw\nHarrisonKornberg\nPGAL\nR
	ockwell Group\nStantec\nUnited Airlines\nSCB \n*This event is open only to
	 AIA Houston and IIDA Members* \nAll attendees are required to wear PPE an
	d boots (steel toe not required). United will be obliged to turn away anyo
	ne not in compliance with the required dress code. \nParking: surface lot 
	available\; includes validated parking.\n\nhttps://architecturehouston.org
	/event/terminalb/\n\nFrom AIA Houston
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/terminalb/
LOCATION:Private: George Bush Intercontinental Airport (IAH)\, 15710 JFK Bo
	ulevard\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
