UID:FtJ2Uf2NC8ImU7WKmy8cG
SUMMARY:Dream Retirement: Advanced Wealth Strategy Evening in the Energy Co
	rridor
DTSTAMP:20260807T044508Z
DTSTART:20260806T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Be Retirement Prepared presents the free\, educational Advanced
	 Wealth Strategy Evening at Hyatt Regency Houston West in the Energy Corri
	dor. \nThe evening will cover advanced tax strategies\, legacy planning\, 
	and withdrawal sequencing designed to protect and preserve your retirement
	 assets. \nThe program will cover the tactics most retirees never consider
	 and the ones that could save significant dollars. \nHighlights\n\n\nAdvan
	ced tax mitigation strategies for your portfolio \n\n\nStrategic Roth conv
	ersion timing and tax efficiency \n\n\nNet Unrealized Appreciation (NUA) s
	trategies for concentrated positions \n\n\nCharitable giving and legacy pl
	anning structures \n\n\nAsset preservation during market downturns \n\n\nW
	ithdrawal sequencing that minimizes tax drag \n\n\nThere will be no pressu
	re and nothing is sold\, just clear guidance and a chance to get your ques
	tions answered. Seating is limited\, so reservations are recommended. \nDo
	ors open at 6:45pm. \nAdmission\nFree with RSVP. RSVP or learn more. \n  \
	nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and b
	oosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about pr
	omoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our 
	channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dream-retirement-adv
	anced-wealth-strategy-evening-in-the-energy-corridor/\n\nFrom 365 Things t
	o Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dream-retirement-advanced-wealt
	h-strategy-evening-in-the-energy-corridor/
LOCATION:Hyatt Regency Houston West\, 1320 Katy Fwy\, Houston\, 77079\, Uni
	ted States
