	y Howard Bossen\, Professor Emeritus of Photography and Visual Communicati
	on\, School of Journalism at Michigan State University. You may register f
	or free as a Presenter and get feedback on your work from Bossen and fello
	w HCP members\, or as an Attendee and partake in the discussion. Our criti
	que groups provide a supportive and professional environment to share your
