UID:japyVZT_I0eYKdsRrgdJ6
SUMMARY:EP University: Project Delivery
DTSTAMP:20260807T044508Z
DTSTART:20260819T113000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the third session of the EP University Lecture Seri
	es: Project Delivery. \nAll architecture projects have fundamentally follo
	wed the same processes from programming\, to design\, to documentation and
	 construction. This course reveals the step-by-step process in delivering 
	a project from conception to reality. \n\nReview the phases of design – Pr
	ogramming\, Site Planning\, Schematic Design\, and Design Development – to
	 understand the processes and deliverables for each phase\nUnderstand the 
	project team member roles – internal and external – and how projects move 
	from person to person and phase to phase\nUnderstand the process of develo
	ping construction documents to execute the design vision – from cartoon se
	t\, to establishing what to draw\, why to draw it\, and what team members 
	are responsible for confirming constructability and details\nReview the pr
	ocess of formally issuing drawings including sealing documents\, labelling
	 drawings\, permitting documents\, transmitting drawings and handling draw
	ing revisions\n\nPresented by Jeanette Shaw of Powers Brown Architecture\,
	 this session offers 1LU CE credit.  \nLunch is provided. \nLocation: Powe
	rs Brown Architecture\, MKT 600 N Shepherd\, Building 3\, Suite 300\, Hous
	ton\, TX 77007 \nAdvanced registration is required. Deadline: Monday\, Aug
	ust 17 at 5PM.\n\nhttps://architecturehouston.org/event/ep-university-proj
	ect-delivery/\n\nFrom AIA Houston
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/ep-university-project-delivery/
LOCATION:Powers Brown Architecture\, MKT 600 N Shepherd\, Building 3\, Suit
	e 300\, Houston\, TX 77007\, 600 N Shepherd\, Building 3\, Ste 300\, Houst
	on\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:aia-houston
CATEGORIES:AIA Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
